{"id":"n31794-1-7","stage":3,"title":"제시 · 提出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31794-1-7-1","ko":"오늘 회의는 어떻게 끝났어?","zh":"今天的会议是怎么结束的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회의는","meaning":"会，会议","explanation":"회의：会，会议；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"회의","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73244","senseId":"1","lemma":"회의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝났어?","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"8ada2d6d6aa420fc","term":"회의","zh":"会，会议","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3","entryId":"73244","definition":"许多人聚在一起讨论；或指这种聚会。","pronunciation":["회ː의","훼ː이"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ef64a8beaa1dc3aa4820.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31794-1-7-2","ko":"별다른 해결책 제시 없이 그냥 끝이 났어.","zh":"没有提出什么特别的解决方案，就这么结束了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"별다른","meaning":"特别，特殊","explanation":"별다르다：特别，特殊；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"별다르다","audio":"/audio/1f499ed8b3569118c527.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14478","senseId":"1","lemma":"별다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해결책","meaning":"解决方法","explanation":"해결책：解决方法","readings":[{"term":"해결책","audio":"/audio/63095db271cfe4514780.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86442","senseId":"1","lemma":"해결책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제시","meaning":"提出","explanation":"제시：提出","readings":[{"term":"제시","audio":"/audio/f9829e1e188f6a8d5099.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31794","senseId":"1","lemma":"제시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없이","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없이：没有","readings":[{"term":"없이","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89918","senseId":"9","lemma":"없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝이","meaning":"完，到头，最后","explanation":"끝：完，到头，最后；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"끝","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48072","senseId":"4","lemma":"끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났어.","meaning":"表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。","explanation":"나다：表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62134","senseId":"2","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1f499ed8b3569118","term":"별다르다","zh":"特别，特殊","audio":"/audio/1f499ed8b3569118c527.mp3","entryId":"14478","definition":"与其他的格外地不同。","pronunciation":["별다르다"]},{"id":"63095db271cfe451","term":"해결책","zh":"解决方法","audio":"/audio/63095db271cfe4514780.mp3","entryId":"86442","definition":"妥善处理或结束事件、问题或事情等的方法。","pronunciation":["해ː결책"]},{"id":"f9829e1e188f6a8d","term":"제시","zh":"提出","audio":"/audio/f9829e1e188f6a8d5099.mp3","entryId":"31794","definition":"将想要做某事的想法通过话语或文字表达出来。","pronunciation":["제시"]},{"id":"c4b723256abd5d51","term":"없이","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/c4b723256abd5d51c1f1.mp3","entryId":"89918","definition":"理由或可能性等不成立地。","pronunciation":["업ː씨"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"fa22cdfb3221d82b","term":"끝","zh":"完，到头，最后","audio":"/audio/fa22cdfb3221d82b98bd.mp3","entryId":"48072","definition":"事情或顺序的最终。","pronunciation":["끋"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62134","definition":"表示前面叙述的动作已经结束。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/842bffa8520b7766d41e.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.809,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31794","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天的会议是怎么结束的？","没有提出什么特别的解决方案，就这么结束了。","我急需用钱，能借给我一点吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天的会议是怎么结束的？","没有提出什么特别的解决方案，就这么结束了。","我急需用钱，能借给我一点吗？"],"answer":1}]}
